---BODY---
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="kicker">Lost Science of Prophetic Engineering · Chart&nbsp;II·b · Plate&nbsp;19</div>
    <h1>Chronotecture
      <span class="sub">The Palindrome of the Great Flood — 1656 years either side of 2239&nbsp;BC</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="prov">A rebuild of Jason&nbsp;M.&nbsp;Breshears’ hand-drawn chart&nbsp;II·b (Breshears&nbsp;’07), with every date, span and annotation preserved verbatim; only the visual language is new. Its structural key: <b>the Great Flood, 2239&nbsp;BC</b>. The 1656 years of the Antediluvian World before it mirror the 1656 years of the Postdiluvian World after it, and four spans (792, 1200, 1656, 3000) reach equally far each way. Beneath, the <b>Anunnaki Ner chronology of 7200 years</b> runs from 5239&nbsp;BC to 1962&nbsp;AD in rulers of 600, and the Stonehenge chronoliths run from the 4309&nbsp;BC impact in rulers of 414. “Total 7344&nbsp;yrs. [7200+72+72 years; 7200+144]”.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="toolbar" id="filters"><span class="lbl">Filter</span></div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>The Flood palindrome and the long counts</h2>
      <div class="hint">Era brackets above; the Flood at the centre; the four mirrored spans with their arcs; then the 600 and 414 rulers and the spans that start or end at the Flood. Hover or tap anything. <span class="anchor-key"><i></i>GREAT FLOOD 2239 BC [1656 AM]</span></div>
      <div class="swipe">⟷ swipe to pan the timeline</div>
      <div class="scroller" data-focus=".4"><svg id="tl" class="wide" viewBox="0 0 1400 960" role="img" aria-label="Chart II·b: the Flood palindrome and the long counts"></svg></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bottom">
      <div class="card"><h2>Cycle mathematics</h2><div class="hint">The arithmetic actually written on the plate, checked (AM&nbsp;=&nbsp;3895&nbsp;−&nbsp;BC or AD&nbsp;+&nbsp;3894; BC to AD spans have no year zero). Figures that do not hold are kept and marked <i>as written</i>.</div><div class="mathgrid">
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1200 + 144 = 1344 = 600 + 744</span><span class="cap">1344 years of PreAdamic History, 5239&nbsp;BC → 3895&nbsp;BC.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">414 × 4 = 1656 = 864 + 792</span><span class="cap">1656 years each side: Antediluvian World 3895&nbsp;BC → 2239&nbsp;BC; Postdiluvian World 2239&nbsp;BC → 583&nbsp;BC [3312&nbsp;AM].</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2239 BC ± 792 → 3031 BC [864 AM] · 1447 BC [2448 AM]</span><span class="cap">864 Annus Mundi ⇄ Ten Plagues &amp; Exodus.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2239 BC ± 1200 → 3439 BC · 1039 BC</span><span class="cap">Anunnaki descend ⇄ King David born.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2239 BC ± 3000 → 5239 BC [−1344 AM] · 762 AD [4656 AM]</span><span class="cap">Anunnaki Ner chronology begun ⇄ Abbasid Dynasty makes Baghdad the seat of the Islamic Empire.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">5239 BC → 1962 AD = 7200 = 600 × 12</span><span class="cap">“5239&nbsp;BC Anunnaki Ner chronology begun; 7200 years to 1962&nbsp;AD.”</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">7200 + 72 + 72 = 7344 = 7200 + 144</span><span class="cap">Total 7344&nbsp;yrs, 5239&nbsp;BC → 2106&nbsp;AD; 1962 + 144 = 2106 [6000&nbsp;AM].</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">4200 = 600 × 7 · 2239 BC → 1962 AD = 4200</span><span class="cap">To end of Anunnaki chronology 1962&nbsp;AD.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">4140 = 414 × 10 · 2239 BC → 1902 AD = 4140</span><span class="cap">Stonehenge chronology to 1902&nbsp;AD [5796&nbsp;AM].</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2070 × 3 = 6210 · 4309 BC → 1902 AD = 6210</span><span class="cap">Stonehenge chronoliths from the 4309&nbsp;BC astroid impact; 1902 + 144 = 2046 impact.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">4309 BC → 2239 BC = 2070</span><span class="cap">Impact to impact 2070&nbsp;yrs. 4309&nbsp;BC = −414&nbsp;AM.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">144 × 20 = 2880 = 360 × 8 · 2239 BC → 641 AD [4535 AM]</span><span class="cap">Muslim destroy Alexandrian Library.</span><span class="aw">as written — 2239&nbsp;BC to 641&nbsp;AD is 2879 years (no year zero; 4535 − 1656 = 2879); 2880 years from the Flood ends in 642&nbsp;AD</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1104 = 552 × 2 · 2239 BC → 1135 BC [2760 AM]</span><span class="cap">Sun darkens by comet occult.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2239 BC → 1688 BC [2208 AM] = 552</span><span class="cap">The first comet occult.</span><span class="aw">as written — 2239 − 552 = 1687&nbsp;BC, and 1656 + 552 = 2208&nbsp;AM is 1687&nbsp;BC; 1688&nbsp;BC is 2207&nbsp;AM, 551 years after the Flood</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2905 BC → 2239 BC = 666 · 2815 BC → 2239 BC = 576 = 144 × 4</span><span class="cap">The pyramid bars; 2815&nbsp;BC = 1080&nbsp;AM.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2905 − 2815 = 90 · 90 × 360 = 32,400 = 10,800 × 3</span><span class="cap">“90 years is 32,400 days [10,800×3]” (360-day years).</span></div>
      </div><div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Read together with chart&nbsp;II·c, which counts the same 552 and 1104 from 1135&nbsp;BC and repeats 1688&nbsp;BC [2208].</div></div>
