        <div><h3>Mirrored bars</h3><ul><li>792 | 792</li><li>3439 BC · 1200 | 1200 · 1039 BC</li><li>1 AM [3895 BC] · 1656 | 1656 · 583 BC [3312 AM]</li><li>5239 BC [−1344 AM] · 3000 yrs | 3000 years · 762 AD [4656 AM]</li></ul></div>
        <div><h3>Rulers</h3><ul><li>600 (twelve segments)</li><li>414 (fifteen segments)</li></ul></div>
        <div><h3>Spans from the Flood</h3><ul><li>Impact to impact 2070 yrs.</li><li>666 years</li><li>576 [144×4]</li><li>4200 yrs [600×7] to end of Anunnaki chronology 1962 AD</li><li>4140 [414×10 Stonehenge chronology] to 1902 AD [5796 AM]</li><li>2880 [144×20 or 360×8] to 641 AD [4535 AM]</li><li>1104 yrs [552×2]</li><li>552</li></ul></div>
